anthedge               the HL logo icon  hydrowart               let's you chat encrypted. The number in the second field must be three digits,               from 000-999.               To get back to unencrypted chat, use a channel number other than 100-999.               When you chat encrypted, you and all the people that are on your "channel" will               have a dot ("·") instead of the ":" behind their name in the chat window               You might think that this makes you log on to a server with two clients, one for               encrypted chat and one for unencrypted. But there's a way to temporarily chat               without encryption! When you start your chat post with the inch symbol ("...),               the text will appear unencrypted in the chat window, so all users can read it.                An example:               This is encrypted looks like this:                      Rvok ok ílqhwsmíx               (depends on channel selected)                "This is unencrypted looks like that:               "This is unencrypted cerfsud (not in v1.2.3)                disabled hard space to soft space conversion (useful for chat spoofing …) fuelharp               announces your leech rating in chat (leech rating is upload/download)               looks like this:                       *** your name announces a LEECH RATING of >>>> n               (can be faked easily with the chat announce feature, see below) sndbuf               Change send buffer size. To set a value, type a size in kilobytes in the               second box. The default is 50. Higher values may or may not result in increased               performance (only on high-speed connections) for uploading files. This does not               affect downloads, only uploads.  bngamya               changes your icon to  (the owner of the correct IP will get  instead - Hinks) beertilxx